---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Hydraulic Part Identification Service" description="Concept page for a future paid hydraulic component identification service based on photos, nameplates and measured dimensions.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Monetization layer</span><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.7rem);margin-top:12px">Part identification service</h1><p class="lead">A future paid workflow for users who have an unknown pump, motor, valve, fitting or other hydraulic component and need a structured identification report.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section compact"><div class="container"><div class="card-grid"><div class="card"><span class="card-icon">01</span><h3>Upload evidence</h3><p>Photos, nameplate, dimensions, machine model and any known operating data.</p></div><div class="card"><span class="card-icon">02</span><h3>Technical review</h3><p>Identify likely family, standards, key specifications and missing measurements.</p></div><div class="card"><span class="card-icon">03</span><h3>Get a report</h3><p>Likely identification, confidence level and possible replacement/specification path.</p></div></div><div class="cta-band" style="margin-top:28px"><div><h2 style="font-size:2rem">Launch later, not on day one</h2><p>Keep this page as a conversion target while organic traffic grows. Add payment and upload handling only after search demand shows that users are reaching identification content.</p></div><span class="btn" aria-disabled="true">Coming later</span></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
